---
description: Implement UI from Bill Snap reference images
alwaysApply: false
---
1. Locate and inspect all relevant reference images in the project root.
2. Identify the screens, order, labels, actions, and form fields they depict.
3. Derive reusable tokens from the images and existing code: surfaces, text, accent, spacing, radii, typography, borders, icons.
4. Translate the concept into the existing platform's native patterns; do not reproduce phone frames, generated-image artefacts, or misspelled text.
5. Prioritise hierarchy, legibility, breathing room, safe areas, keyboard behaviour, and scrolling.
6. Reuse shared tokens/components rather than hard-coding near-duplicate values.
7. If an image conflicts with `/AGENTS.md`, follow the product decisions and report the conflict.
